 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Family",
   "texto": [
    "**Aile** means «Family». The possessive joins the name: **annem** (my mother), **babam** (my father), **kardeşim** (my brother / a).",
    "The «mi» suffix is usually **-(I)m**; it takes a link vowel when the name ends in consonant: **evim** (my house).",
    "**Ailem** is «My family». **Kim?** means «Who?»."
   ]
  },
